</fieldset>
<div class="footer-picker__visual">
<p class="eyebrow">FOOTER PREVIEW / 排版結構示意</p>
<div class="footer-picker__stage" id="footer-preview">
<div class="footer-mock"><div class="footer-mock__identity"><span class="footer-mock__eyebrow">YOUR PERSONAL SITE</span><strong id="footer-preview-brand">我的個人網站</strong><p id="footer-preview-tagline">一個可以慢慢整理內容的地方。</p></div><div class="footer-mock__columns" id="footer-preview-columns"><div><b>網站導覽</b><span>文章</span><span>關於我</span></div></div></div>
<div class="footer-mock__bottom"><small id="footer-preview-copyright">© 2026 我的個人網站</small><span id="footer-preview-legal">隱私權／法律頁面未設定，正式網站不顯示假連結</span></div>
